@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBorderColor #555555
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #B39B4D
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBorderColor #8899AA
hide circle
hide empty members
title 第 4 週：所有事情都在 MissionLog 一個類別裡

class MissionLog #F4F4F4 {
  + {static} main(args : String[]) : void
  ~ {static} runMission(script : int[], energy : int, samples : int) : void
  ~ {static} countCommands(commandLog : ArrayList<Integer>) : int[]
  ~ {static} printReplay(commandLog, energyLog, resultLog) : void
  ~ {static} printSummary(scriptLength, energyLog, resultLog) : void
  ~ {static} calculateBatteryPercent(energy : int) : double
}
class FixedScriptMission #F4F4F4 {
  + {static} main(args : String[]) : void
}
FixedScriptMission ..> MissionLog : 呼叫 runMission
note right of MissionLog
  <b>runMission 裡的區域變數</b>
  ・目前狀態：energy、samples、actionCount、running
  ・歷史：三條平行清單
  　commandLog　ArrayList<Integer>
  　energyLog　　ArrayList<Integer>
  　resultLog　　ArrayList<String>
  第 i 步的資料散在三條清單的第 i 格，
  <b>三條必須一起 add，也不能只排序其中一條</b>
end note
@enduml
